 live my life without a single voice."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "In this crazy world, I\u2019m an alien sight,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "I\u2019m the quirky singer, Mr. Fantasy in the light."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}